1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
Cinderella

2
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:11,060
Cinderella's Sister

3
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,600
Cinderella's Sister

4
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,130
Episode 14

5
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,090
Is it possible...

6
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,170
I wonder if it's possible, Father.

7
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:36,690
Can't you give everything up?

8
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:43,210
Also, the position of Hong Joo Ga's Chairman,

9
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:45,980
Can't you step down from it?

10
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:52,530
Maybe that could be the easiest way out.

11
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:58,940
It's much easier letting go of it than trying to hold onto it.

12
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:07,830
I also have a dream, if my father only does that for me...

13
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:14,720
What you, Gyung and I did to Dae Seong True Winemakers...

14
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:18,460
I'll reveal everything and take responsibility for it all.

15
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:21,930
After I set up the company to the extent that it was when Ajusshi was alive.

16
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:26,910
With Father who is no longer of the Hongju Corporation

17
00:01:26,910 --> 00:01:30,020
in a small house, I will look after you.

18
00:01:30,890 --> 00:01:37,040
I will play Baduk with you and fish.

19
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:44,880
This is really one in ten thousand but if by any chance...

20
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:48,510
A certain brat forgives me,

21
00:01:48,510 --> 00:01:53,140
I'll plead on my knees and beg you to take her in as your daughter-in-law,

22
00:01:53,140 --> 00:01:56,180
and we'll give you pocket money from what we earn.

23
00:01:57,160 --> 00:02:01,020
When my child is born, you can help us raise them.

24
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:03,540
That's how I'd love to live.

25
00:02:04,850 --> 00:02:09,140
Father, can't give everything up like that?

26
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:11,490
Can't you do it for me, Father?

27
00:02:11,490 --> 00:02:14,980
Please answer me. Can't you do that for me, Father?

28
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:20,890
That fact that you fainted after hearing I would leave you

29
00:02:20,890 --> 00:02:24,940
probably means you don't want to lose me either.

30
00:02:24,940 --> 00:02:28,410
Isn't that right, Father? Isn't it?!

31
00:02:33,350 --> 00:02:35,900
I can't let go.

32
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:40,410
I won't.

33
00:02:42,130 --> 00:02:45,420
I won't do anything to you.

34
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:49,850
So, from now on don't try to touch me either.

35
00:02:51,450 --> 00:02:56,670
Whatever unlimited responsibility you feel towards Dae Seong True Winemakers,

36
00:02:56,670 --> 00:03:04,780
whether you live your life as Dae Seong True Winemaker's protector, or as a mere fisherman,

37
00:03:04,790 --> 00:03:08,000
I won't care about all that anymore.

38
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:19,010
However... Although I won't lift a finger against you, Gi Jeong will be different.

39
00:03:19,870 --> 00:03:22,930
Gi Jeong will shake you.

40
00:03:25,050 --> 00:03:30,680
If it comes to be too much, you'll also need me to fight back.

41
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:36,210
You can go.

42
00:03:37,170 --> 00:03:40,890
Don't you have to get back to protecting Dae Seong True Winemakers?

43
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:02,160
I can't lean on you?

44
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:12,990
Go ahead.

45
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:37,140
I'm heartbroken, Mom.

46
00:05:37,770 --> 00:05:39,830
Officially.

47
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:48,640
There's someone I like.

48
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:51,950
You didn't know, right?

49
00:05:57,320 --> 00:06:03,280
That person rejected me.

50
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:53,490
I drove her into the neighborhood, but how could I get any closer than this?

51
00:06:53,490 --> 00:06:56,620
You come and bring her home.

52
00:07:14,230 --> 00:07:16,970
I'm leaving.

53
00:07:18,740 --> 00:07:20,570
Ajusshi.

54
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:25,200
Do you have a place to go?

55
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,980
Ajusshi.

56
00:07:37,630 --> 00:07:39,770
Put it away!

57
00:07:43,170 --> 00:07:48,170
If you need money, don't go to Noona's mom. Contact me instead.

58
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,920
I'll be fine!

59
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:58,360
Don't ever come here, just tell me to meet you wherever you are.

60
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:00,150
Got it?

61
00:08:11,830 --> 00:08:14,870
Noona, are you okay?

62
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:36,810
♫ In the solitude which wakes me up ♫

63
00:08:38,260 --> 00:08:43,980
♫ when I wake up from an exhausted sleep ♫

64
00:08:45,770 --> 00:08:52,270
♫ because I still remember you smiling ♫

65
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:58,120
♫ I'm secretly smiling ♫

66
00:09:00,730 --> 00:09:06,130
♫ Love leaves again this way ♫

67
00:09:08,070 --> 00:09:13,170
♫ When the beautiful season arrives ♫

68
00:09:15,330 --> 00:09:21,880
♫ In the sadness you left in the longing ♫

69
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:27,450
♫ I walk this street again ♫

70
00:09:27,450 --> 00:09:34,760
♫ I am living day after day  ♫

71
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:43,800
♫ In your name when tears appear, ah ♫

72
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:46,480
♫  I can't bear it ♫

73
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:51,210
♫ So I can't laugh ♫

74
00:09:51,210 --> 00:09:59,930
♫ I'll call out your name again ♫

75
00:09:59,930 --> 00:10:01,890
Unni.

76
00:10:03,490 --> 00:10:07,490
Can you keep me company?

77
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:14,460
Why?

78
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:25,570
I...got rejected by the man I like.

79
00:10:29,350 --> 00:10:33,510
I got rejected.

80
00:10:39,650 --> 00:10:42,130
Can you keep me company?

81
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:55,540
My heart...

82
00:10:57,980 --> 00:11:02,820
really feels like it's been torn apart, Unni.

83
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:38,130
Jeong Woo.

84
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,490
Jeong Woo!

85
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:49,090
I have something to say.

86
00:11:49,090 --> 00:11:51,360
Tell him to come out.

87
00:11:57,540 --> 00:11:59,810
Jeong Woo, are you asleep?

88
00:12:01,310 --> 00:12:06,620
Let your roommate come out.

89
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:14,390
You said you would take care of her!

90
00:12:14,390 --> 00:12:17,060
You said you would look after her.

91
00:12:17,060 --> 00:12:19,600
How can you abandon her now?

92
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:24,330
How can you do that to someone who already feels like their skin has come off?

93
00:12:24,330 --> 00:12:27,870
Do you know what kind of girl she is?

94
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:33,150
Although she knows Mom and I aren't on her side, and keep pushing her away,

95
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:37,280
she still thinks it's a blessing to have a sister and mother like that.

96
00:12:37,920 --> 00:12:43,980
There was only one person she could openly like with all her heart.

97
00:12:44,830 --> 00:12:48,120
Did you have to do that to her?

98
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:52,470
Are you done with your nonsense?

99
00:12:53,370 --> 00:12:54,800
What?

100
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:58,990
Do I have to accept her? No matter the circumstances?

101
00:12:59,670 --> 00:13:02,270
Am I supposed to like a kid that I've never seen as a woman

102
00:13:02,270 --> 00:13:05,700
just because she likes me no matter what?

103
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:09,280
Am I supposed to disregard my own feelings?

104
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:12,790
Why? Because I'm indebted to Ajusshi?

105
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:15,680
I should accept her to repay my debts?

106
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:18,890
Is that how you repay your debts?

107
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:22,080
- Why does it have to be now—
- Stop.

108
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:24,340
Don't say it, you brat.

109
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:26,780
Do you really mean what you're saying?

110
00:13:26,780 --> 00:13:30,220
Can you really put your hand on your heart and say it's true?

111
00:13:30,220 --> 00:13:34,170
Is this really what you want to say to me?

112
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,180
Do you want me to say

113
00:13:37,180 --> 00:13:43,130
"You're right, I was wrong. I'll accept Hyo Seon. What do you want me to do?" in front of you?

114
00:13:43,130 --> 00:13:45,920
Is that really what you want to hear?

115
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:48,190
Is that what you really want?

116
00:13:51,010 --> 00:13:52,510
Then what do I really feel?

117
00:13:52,510 --> 00:13:54,220
- You know it.
- What?

118
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:55,520
- What?
- Yeah, what?

119
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:59,720
You... I...

120
00:14:09,260 --> 00:14:11,710
You try saying such things to me again.

121
00:14:11,710 --> 00:14:13,720
If you say that to me again,

122
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:17,300
my urge to be shameless and throw away everything will surface

123
00:14:17,300 --> 00:14:19,140
and make me want to forget everything,

124
00:14:19,140 --> 00:14:23,570
disregard Ajusshi's kindness, disregard my sins, and just throw it all aside.

125
00:14:27,500 --> 00:14:29,860
All I need is you.

126
00:14:32,670 --> 00:14:34,750
As long as I have you,

127
00:14:34,750 --> 00:14:39,030
I can live on and shamelessly forget all my sins.

128
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:46,930
That's really all I want.

129
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:53,490
Hyo Seon....

130
00:14:56,260 --> 00:15:01,660
Is that really what you want?

131
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,460
Huh?

132
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,950
Huh?!

133
00:15:18,810 --> 00:15:25,530
♫ Again today my memory led me astray ♫

134
00:15:25,530 --> 00:15:31,310
♫ I who am strolling at the end of the street ♫

135
00:15:32,730 --> 00:15:39,790
♫ where you can't hold me again ♫

136
00:15:39,790 --> 00:15:41,520
I can't, Eun Jo.

137
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:45,730
♫ I ask again about the way ♫

138
00:15:45,730 --> 00:15:48,800
It's already too late.

139
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:53,360
I can't.

140
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:58,090
You may not understand, but I can't.

141
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:02,140
♫ It must be you ♫

142
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:04,770
Although it's so unfair that it drives me crazy,

143
00:16:04,770 --> 00:16:07,750
♫ I cannot be without you. ♫

144
00:16:07,750 --> 00:16:09,710
I can't.

145
00:16:09,710 --> 00:16:14,700
♫ Like this for another day, month or year. ♫

146
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:18,250
♫ I don't mind even if I am hurt. ♫

147
00:16:18,250 --> 00:16:22,160
♫ I don't mind even if my heart breaks ♫

148
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:28,350
♫ because, yes, you are the only one I love. ♫

149
00:16:28,350 --> 00:16:30,010
♫ My bruised heart ♫

150
00:16:30,010 --> 00:16:35,640
Please reconsider Hyo Seon.

151
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:36,800
♫ I can find you.  ♫

152
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:39,670
If she suffers any more,

153
00:16:42,170 --> 00:16:47,810
I really don't think I can handle it.

154
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:54,170
♫ Come to me. ♫

155
00:16:54,170 --> 00:16:57,450
♫ Even if I live again ♫

156
00:16:57,450 --> 00:17:01,710
♫ No matter how many times I am reborn ♫

157
00:17:01,710 --> 00:17:08,610
♫ There isn't a day that I can live without you. ♫

158
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:11,950
♫ The love I will protect ♫

159
00:17:11,950 --> 00:17:14,780
♫ The love I love ♫

160
00:17:14,780 --> 00:17:15,950
♫ Because for me ♫

161
00:17:15,950 --> 00:17:22,320
♫ Yes, if it's just you, it is enough ♫

162
00:17:24,060 --> 00:17:32,490
♫ because you are the only one I love. ♫

163
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:03,140
Come back safely.

164
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:04,480
I will.

165
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:07,250
Did you take enough samples?

166
00:18:07,910 --> 00:18:09,580
Yeah.

167
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:16,730
It'll definitely succeed if we use that machine, right?

168
00:18:18,310 --> 00:18:20,230
I'll try my best.

169
00:18:22,820 --> 00:18:27,280
You have to keep your promise to hang out with me when you're back.

170
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:29,380
I will.

171
00:18:29,380 --> 00:18:33,250
Noona, get in. There's not much time left before the flight.

172
00:18:33,250 --> 00:18:35,380
Come back safely.

173
00:19:06,850 --> 00:19:09,050
There's still a lot of work to do at the winery.

174
00:19:11,330 --> 00:19:14,060
I know.

175
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:17,850
You're responsible for it all while Eun Jo is in Japan.

176
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:21,910
I got it.

177
00:19:22,590 --> 00:19:27,580
You go ahead first. I have to go back and get something.

178
00:19:43,190 --> 00:19:46,300
Dong Soo, it's me.

179
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:50,180
How is the favor I asked you for going?

180
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:55,370
Okay.

181
00:19:57,280 --> 00:20:01,170
Please keep working on it for me. I'll be waiting.

182
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:04,460
What favor?

183
00:20:05,080 --> 00:20:07,030
You don't need to know.

184
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,470
How long are you going for?

185
00:20:12,130 --> 00:20:13,820
Huh?

186
00:20:14,850 --> 00:20:17,380
I asked you how long you're going for?

187
00:20:18,490 --> 00:20:20,110
Huh?

188
00:20:21,770 --> 00:20:23,910
What did you say?

189
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:27,070
Never mind. It's okay.

190
00:20:36,280 --> 00:20:38,700
You try saying those words to me again.

191
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:40,710
If you say that to me again,

192
00:20:40,710 --> 00:20:44,300
my urge to be shameless and throw away everything will surface

193
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:46,160
and make me want to forget everything,

194
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:50,590
disregard Ajusshi's kindness, disregard my sins, and just throw it all to the side.

195
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:56,870
All I need is you.

196
00:20:59,580 --> 00:21:01,680
As long as I have you,

197
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:06,050
I can live on and shamelessly forget all my sins.

198
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:13,880
That's all I want.

199
00:21:45,450 --> 00:21:47,340
Where is she now?

200
00:21:51,500 --> 00:21:55,320
Wait a moment. Don't tell her that it was me...

201
00:22:02,220 --> 00:22:05,000
Joon Soo's mom, are you inside?!

202
00:22:06,930 --> 00:22:09,590
What brings you here so suddenly without calling first?

203
00:22:09,590 --> 00:22:11,740
Please go in.

204
00:22:23,310 --> 00:22:26,510
What do you mean, Aunt?

205
00:22:26,510 --> 00:22:29,530
I already heard about it before I came so don't even think about denying it.

206
00:22:29,530 --> 00:22:32,490
Quietly pack your bags and leave this house.

207
00:22:33,140 --> 00:22:35,760
To pack my bags?

208
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:39,650
What do you mean by that?

209
00:22:39,650 --> 00:22:43,000
For the last 8 years, you've been deceiving Hyo Seon's father

210
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:46,180
and you've been leading a double life, haven't you?!

211
00:22:46,180 --> 00:22:47,950
Pardon?

212
00:22:52,210 --> 00:22:54,530
What are you talking about?

213
00:22:54,530 --> 00:22:56,940
You don't have to say anything else.

214
00:22:56,940 --> 00:22:59,330
Because you're the mother of Joon Soo,

215
00:22:59,330 --> 00:23:03,800
I'll keep the secret from my Hyo Seon and everyone else,

216
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:06,340
so be grateful that I am agreeing to keep my mouth shut

217
00:23:06,340 --> 00:23:09,130
and leave this house immediately.

218
00:23:10,190 --> 00:23:17,100
No, Aunt. I have no idea what you're talking about.

219
00:23:17,100 --> 00:23:21,550
Aigoo, my poor nephew!

220
00:23:21,550 --> 00:23:25,400
Only the person gone is pitiful.

221
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:29,900
I knew one day something like this would happen,

222
00:23:29,900 --> 00:23:32,300
I just knew it!

223
00:23:33,290 --> 00:23:38,590
Aigoo, what a disgrace to our family!

224
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:42,170
Stop making such a ruckus! Do you have any evidence?

225
00:23:43,470 --> 00:23:44,920
I asked if you have any evidence.

226
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:48,100
If you can find evidence of my double life, bring it to me!

227
00:23:48,100 --> 00:23:50,550
This manipulative fox!

228
00:23:52,050 --> 00:23:53,990
Who said that?

229
00:23:53,990 --> 00:23:57,450
Who are you to be looking for dirt on someone as clean as myself!

230
00:23:57,450 --> 00:24:00,270
I gave birth to Joon Soo.

231
00:24:00,270 --> 00:24:04,260
President Goo Dae Seong's son Goo Joon Soo. I was the one who gave birth to him!

232
00:24:04,260 --> 00:24:06,900
Why should I pack my bags?

233
00:24:06,900 --> 00:24:11,270
I know you haven't liked me for a long time, but you doing this to me, it is too much!

234
00:24:11,270 --> 00:24:15,680
- This little bitch!
- Oh my, oh my! What are you doing?

235
00:24:18,560 --> 00:24:21,000
What are you going? Get up!

236
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:23,420
Come on, let go!

237
00:24:23,420 --> 00:24:25,520
You little!

238
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:27,470
Why are you doing this?

239
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:50,830
I wonder if it's possible to feel more wronged.

240
00:24:51,660 --> 00:24:57,600
She hasn't liked me since I stepped foot in this house.

241
00:24:57,600 --> 00:25:02,630
She's trying to kick me out as soon as Joon Soo's dad passed.

242
00:25:02,630 --> 00:25:07,960
She cursed me with words one shouldn't ever speak!

243
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:11,890
I feel so wronged I don't know what to do!

244
00:25:15,910 --> 00:25:17,670
What?

245
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:23,090
Yes, Auntie Choi Jang!

246
00:25:28,280 --> 00:25:29,940
Yes?

247
00:25:31,430 --> 00:25:37,260
Yes. Please call me back then.

248
00:26:00,520 --> 00:26:02,750
Hello?

249
00:26:02,750 --> 00:26:07,320
Hello, Hyo Seon's Grandfather.

250
00:26:07,320 --> 00:26:12,380
This is Hyo Seon's Mother. You haven't been ill in all this time, right?

251
00:26:13,390 --> 00:26:19,960
It's just that I've suddenly experienced something so terrible,

252
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:22,780
I didn't know what to do but thought you,

253
00:26:22,780 --> 00:26:27,310
who have always helped me out,

254
00:26:28,990 --> 00:26:33,130
would know what sort of advice to give me.

255
00:26:35,640 --> 00:26:41,170
I feel so wronged I don't know what to do!

256
00:26:43,450 --> 00:26:46,810
I'm telling you that's what happened! Why can't you understand what I'm saying?

257
00:26:46,810 --> 00:26:50,060
I'm telling you that's what I heard.

258
00:26:50,060 --> 00:26:54,020
I'm sure I heard her planning something

259
00:26:54,020 --> 00:26:56,960
with the older daughter and the kid here!

260
