♫  I am living day after day  ♫

509
00:49:49,070 --> 00:49:58,130
♫  In your name when tears appear again,  ♫

510
00:49:58,130 --> 00:50:01,520
♫  I can't bear it  ♫

511
00:50:01,520 --> 00:50:05,520
What shampoo do you use, my baby?

512
00:50:05,520 --> 00:50:16,450
♫  I call out your name again  ♫

513
00:50:24,490 --> 00:50:30,160
What the hell? What's the point of working to survive if you've worked yourself to death?

514
00:50:31,520 --> 00:50:35,800
Let's just go quietly, Jeong Woo. I can't stand the noise.

515
00:50:35,800 --> 00:50:38,540
- I guess I 'm going to the hospital.
- Go to the winery.

516
00:50:38,540 --> 00:50:40,700
I'm going to the hospital.

517
00:50:42,460 --> 00:50:44,530
Go to the winery.

518
00:50:44,530 --> 00:50:47,280
You girl... really.

519
00:50:52,050 --> 00:50:56,990
Dae Seong True Winemakers

520
00:51:14,170 --> 00:51:17,210
What on earth is that supposed to mean?

521
00:51:17,210 --> 00:51:19,690
Your explanation is insufficient!

522
00:51:19,690 --> 00:51:23,390
Hello? Hello?!

523
00:51:27,830 --> 00:51:29,900
What's going on?

524
00:51:31,120 --> 00:51:32,690
Unni.

525
00:51:32,690 --> 00:51:35,030
They said they're going to cancel the machine rental.

526
00:51:35,030 --> 00:51:39,070
What?

527
00:51:39,070 --> 00:51:41,130
Their order too.

528
00:51:42,070 --> 00:51:44,130
What did you say?

529
00:51:44,130 --> 00:51:48,720
They're cancelling their order too.

530
00:51:49,390 --> 00:51:51,140
What's that supposed to mean?

531
00:51:51,160 --> 00:51:54,820
Even right before I came here, it was firmly promised.

532
00:52:01,030 --> 00:52:02,920
What's wrong with you?

533
00:52:03,860 --> 00:52:06,790
Unni. Unni! What to do?

534
00:52:06,790 --> 00:52:08,720
- Unni! Oppa...
- What's wrong?

535
00:52:08,750 --> 00:52:10,420
- What?
- Unni.

536
00:52:10,440 --> 00:52:11,990
Let's go outside.

537
00:52:13,030 --> 00:52:15,140
What's wrong with Noona?

538
00:52:16,570 --> 00:52:18,400
Open the door.

539
00:52:26,920 --> 00:52:28,730
Move.

540
00:53:28,660 --> 00:53:35,650
Hello, this is Dae Seong True Winemakers. (In Jpapanese)

541
00:53:37,080 --> 00:53:40,160
Regarding the cancellation of your order,

542
00:53:40,160 --> 00:53:45,130
I'd like to hear a detailed explanation.

543
00:53:56,570 --> 00:53:58,860
Go to the winery.

544
00:54:00,010 --> 00:54:01,880
Lay back down.

545
00:54:03,910 --> 00:54:08,310
It's just fatigue. Just go to the winery.

546
00:54:08,310 --> 00:54:10,920
I said lay back down, you wench!

547
00:54:29,220 --> 00:54:33,350
You have a call from Dae Seong True Winemakers' Goo Hyo Seon. Should I put her through?

548
00:54:48,060 --> 00:54:50,340
My name is Hong Gi Jeong.

549
00:54:53,290 --> 00:54:55,300
Please sit down.

550
00:55:03,310 --> 00:55:07,980
I don't have much time. Please tell me what you want.

551
00:55:09,360 --> 00:55:13,690
The Japanese contract signed with us, you...

552
00:55:17,050 --> 00:55:20,260
I didn't come out to discuss that with a young child.

553
00:55:21,590 --> 00:55:23,280
What did you say?

554
00:55:23,280 --> 00:55:26,570
What does your contract have to do with us?

555
00:55:26,570 --> 00:55:29,700
We just made a deal with Miyura-san.

556
00:55:29,700 --> 00:55:34,720
Miyura-san is the one that debated the options and decided to go with us.

557
00:55:34,720 --> 00:55:39,500
By any chance, are you going to bring up fair play or something along those lines?

558
00:55:40,590 --> 00:55:45,700
- We had to go through so much to...
- I don't care what you had to do to get this contract.

559
00:55:46,560 --> 00:55:49,380
I also had a hard time getting this contract.

560
00:55:50,290 --> 00:55:55,270
All I did was make a proposal to them, regardless of your company's actions.

561
00:55:55,270 --> 00:55:59,750
If there's been an issue that came up regarding a breach of contract, that's between you and Miyura.

562
00:55:59,750 --> 00:56:02,120
It has nothing to do with me.

563
00:56:13,780 --> 00:56:16,920
Are you the older sister or the younger sister?

564
00:56:18,320 --> 00:56:22,200
Are you the one who's been researching yeast?

565
00:56:23,750 --> 00:56:25,300
Why are you curious about that?

566
00:56:25,300 --> 00:56:29,300
If you're that person, I have something I want to say to you.

567
00:56:32,140 --> 00:56:36,920
And what is it that you want to say?

568
00:56:36,920 --> 00:56:41,190
Are you researching yeast?

569
00:56:43,860 --> 00:56:45,610
No.

570
00:56:45,610 --> 00:56:48,760
Then you must be the younger sister.

571
00:56:48,760 --> 00:56:53,170
Please tell your unni that I'd like to meet her.

572
00:56:55,180 --> 00:56:58,660
I wondered whether you are the older sister or not so that's why I came out.

573
00:56:58,660 --> 00:57:02,190
If I had known there would be a child who knows nothing about the world,

574
00:57:02,190 --> 00:57:04,680
I wouldn't have wasted my time on purpose.

575
00:57:26,070 --> 00:57:27,900
Look here!

576
00:57:28,820 --> 00:57:32,760
Look here! Look here!

577
00:57:48,670 --> 00:57:50,120
Oppa.

578
00:57:50,120 --> 00:57:53,850
Eun Jo was admitted to the hospital for a day.

579
00:57:53,850 --> 00:57:58,850
Your mother will watch her, so she says to sleep with Joon Soo.

580
00:58:00,610 --> 00:58:02,730
It's Hong Joo Ga.

581
00:58:04,230 --> 00:58:11,020
Instead of ours, they said they would accept the Hong Ju Brewery Takju for nearly nothing.

582
00:58:12,840 --> 00:58:16,970
How did you know that?

583
00:58:17,920 --> 00:58:22,260
Then, does that mean you knew already?

584
00:58:23,070 --> 00:58:24,660
How did you...?

585
00:58:24,660 --> 00:58:26,920
Why is Hong Joo Ga doing this to us?

586
00:58:26,920 --> 00:58:30,290
They're already a large company,

587
00:58:30,290 --> 00:58:33,820
and defeating such a small company like us won't even benefit that much.

588
00:58:33,820 --> 00:58:39,020
That scumbag... Does he think I'll leave him alone?

589
00:58:39,990 --> 00:58:43,420
I'm supposed to meet Dong Soo tomorrow.

590
00:58:43,420 --> 00:58:47,710
I'll use all of my strength to prevent him from doing this.

591
00:58:47,710 --> 00:58:52,940
That... Scumbag.

592
00:58:52,940 --> 00:58:57,130
I met Hong Joo Ga's heir Hong Gi Jeong.

593
00:58:58,860 --> 00:59:03,090
You met that person?

594
00:59:03,090 --> 00:59:05,700
I won't leave him be.

595
00:59:05,700 --> 00:59:09,070
I'm just not going to let him do this.

596
01:00:15,290 --> 01:00:17,290
It's Dad's handwriting!

597
01:00:17,290 --> 01:00:20,530
Your father said this.

598
01:00:20,530 --> 01:00:25,930
He said he was afraid of continue living his life without me.

599
01:00:49,090 --> 01:00:53,950
- Are you okay?
- I'm okay. No problem at all.

600
01:00:53,950 --> 01:00:56,320
You're going to rest today, right?

601
01:00:58,440 --> 01:01:01,990
I'm going to go out after I change my clothes.

602
01:01:07,510 --> 01:01:09,900
You can leave now, Mom.

603
01:01:13,880 --> 01:01:18,020
If you and I are kicked out of this house today,

604
01:01:18,020 --> 01:01:21,200
what are we going to do?

605
01:01:21,200 --> 01:01:24,800
Mom, I can't hear anything you're saying.

606
01:01:29,300 --> 01:01:32,950
The contract we made isn't going well. This is our first priority.

607
01:01:32,950 --> 01:01:35,780
If this contract goes wrong, Mom and I will have to pack our bags

608
01:01:35,780 --> 01:01:38,890
even if we're not kicked out of this house.

609
01:02:59,360 --> 01:03:02,770
♫  It must be you  ♫

610
01:03:02,770 --> 01:03:06,710
♫  I cannot be without you  ♫

611
01:03:06,710 --> 01:03:13,590
♫  Like this for another day, month or year  ♫

612
01:03:13,590 --> 01:03:17,200
♫  I don't mind even if I am hurt  ♫

613
01:03:17,200 --> 01:03:21,170
♫  I don't mind even if my heart breaks  ♫

614
01:03:21,170 --> 01:03:27,350
♫  because, yes, you are the only one I love  ♫

615
01:03:27,350 --> 01:03:33,130
♫  My bruised heart is shouting so that  ♫
